<title>USA: Missouri lean hog carcass values - Nov 14.</title>
<headline>Missouri lean hog carcass values - Nov 14.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY, MO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plant delivered prices on 50-51 percent lean slaughter hogs with a carcass weight of 172-195 lbs were steady to 1.00 higher than Wednesday's close.</p>
<p>Price range (dollars/cwt) 78.74-80.05</p>
<p>Estimated Receipts: 1250</p>
<p>Note: Producer reported prices with grade premiums or discounts included.</p>
<p>Source: Missouri Department of Agriculture-USDA Livestock Market News</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
